  <ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock id="f-9" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;9. See System Energy&#8217;s 2025 FERC Form 1 Notes to Financial Statements, Notes 2 and 8. See System Energy&#8217;s 2026 FERC Form 3Q For the Quarterly Period Ended March 31, 2026 Notes to Financial Statements, Notes 1 and 2.&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock>
