    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-3" id="fn-3" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Includes nuclear plant under sale/leaseback of $680,810,974. Also includes $200,764,309 related to asset retirement cost assets.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-4" id="fn-4" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Includes a credit balance of $434,992,815 of accumulated provision for amortization of plant under sale-leaseback.&#160; Also includes a credit balance of $128,975,254 for asset retirement obligation-related accumulated provisions.</link:footnote>
