    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-6" id="fn-6" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Withdrawals and allocation adjustments related to the regulated nuclear pool.</link:footnote>
