    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-8" id="fn-8" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Excludes service company depreciation allocations of $1,729,406 and expense reclassifications of ($167,797) since these allocations and reclassifications do not offset to accumulated reserves. (They are included in the depreciation expense shown on page 336.)</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-9" id="fn-9" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents third party sales of inventory.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-10" id="fn-10" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents the Grand Gulf Accelerated Recovery Tariff approved by the FERC that provided for the acceleration of Entergy Arkansas's Grand Gulf purchased power obligations with System Energy Resources.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-11" id="fn-11" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote"/>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-12" id="fn-12" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Includes $19 of service company amortization billing allocations.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-13" id="fn-13" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Includes $1,729,406 of service company depreciation billing allocations.</link:footnote>
